ADDENDA <Presidential Decree No. 28799, Apr. 17, 2018>
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Decree shall enter into force on April 17, 2018.
Article 2 (Repeal of other statutes)
The Regulations concerning the Establishment and Operation of the Science and Technology Strategy Council are hereby repealed.
Article 3 (Transitional measures concerning expert advisors)
An expert advisor appointed pursuant to the former Article 5 as at the time this Decree enters into force shall be deemed appointed as the expert advisor pursuant to the amended provisions of Article 5.
Article 4 (Transitional measures concerning Steering Committee)
The Steering Committee; the Expert Committee; the Special Committee; the working committee; the Local Science and Technology Promotion Council; the working council and the Basic Research Promotion Council under the former Enforcement Decree of the Framework Act on Science and Technology (referring to the Enforcement Decree of the Framework Act on Science and Technology before it is amended by Presidential Decree No. 28800; hereinafter the same shall apply) as at the time this Decree enters into force shall be deemed the Steering Committee; the Expert Committee; the Special Committee; the working committee; the Local Council; the working council and the Basic Research Council under this Decree, respectively.
Article 5 (Transitional measures concerning members of Steering Committee)
Members of the Steering Committee; the Expert Committee; the Special Committee; the Local Science and Technology Promotion Council and the Basic Research Promotion Council appointed or commissioned pursuant to the former Enforcement Decree of the Framework Act on Science and Technology as at the time this Decree enters into force shall be deemed appointed or commissioned as members of the Steering Committee; the Expert Committee; the Special Committee; the Local Council and the Basic Research Council pursuant to this Decree, respectively. In such cases, the term of office of a member commissioned shall be the remainder of the former term of office.
Article 6 Omitted.
Article 7 (Relationship to other statutes or regulations)
Where the provisions of the former Enforcement Decree of the Presidential Advisory Council on Science and Technology Act are cited by other statutes as at the time this Decree enters into force, in which case the provisions corresponding thereto exist in this Decree, the relevant provisions of this Decree shall be deemed cited in lieu of the former provisions.

